# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible.
#
# NOTE: Docker reads the ignore file from the BUILD CONTEXT ROOT (here the repo root),
# i.e. it looks for `./.dockerignore`. Because the Dockerfiles live in deploy/, copy this
# file to the repo root before building, or let CI do it:
#
#     cp deploy/.dockerignore .dockerignore
#     docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile -t visionserve .
#
# (BuildKit also auto-detects `deploy/Dockerfile.dockerignore` if you name it that way.)
#
# Patterns are matched from the CONTEXT ROOT: `*.onnx` only matches a file AT the root. Anything
# that can sit in a sub-directory (weights under models/<name>/, sample images) must be written
# `**/<pattern>`, or it is sent as build context (models/ alone holds several GB of weights).
#
# What the builds need: the Go sources (cmd/, internal/, pkg/, go.mod, go.sum) for every image;
# clients/python and convert/ for Dockerfile.convert. Nothing else.

# VCS / CI
.git
.github
.gitignore

# Build outputs (binary is rebuilt inside the image)
bin/
visionserve

# Model registry: weights + manifests are pulled at runtime into the /root/.models volume,
# never baked into an image.
models/

# Model weights, checkpoints & exported artifacts, wherever they live
**/*.onnx
**/*.onnx.data
**/*.data
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.engine
**/*.trt
**/*.tflite
**/*.h5
**/*.keras

# Images, media & documents (sample/test data, slides, figures)
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.webp
**/*.gif
**/*.mp4
**/*.pdf
**/*.pptx

# Demo / sample / client material not needed by the server build
demo/
# clients/python IS needed: it holds the converter package (Dockerfile.convert).
clients/js/
clients/python/dist/
clients/python/examples/
clients/python/*.egg-info/
clients/python/tests/
scripts/
docs/
paper/
results/
blog/
benchmarks/
eval/
test/

# Local tooling / editor / language-runtime noise
.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/coverage.*
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/

# Jetson ORT drop-in is only consumed by Dockerfile.edge (kept out of CPU/x64 builds)
# Comment the next line out if you build the Jetson variant from this context.
deploy/ort-jetson/
